{"data":{"body":"[P2] Preserve legacy zero-delay retry compatibility. `RetryDecision.retry(null)` normalizes to `Duration.ZERO`, and existing step handling also accepted an explicit zero as an immediate retry. Passing either value to `ExtensionStepResult.retry` now invokes duration validation that rejects delays below one second, so existing custom `RetryStrategy` implementations throw instead of retrying. Handle zero specially in this adapter and cover both null and explicit-zero decisions.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7oVrrE","finding_digest":"b2c922396448a5ef93a32832c5d88f6905930bf74b323d2e6b1436aabcc72570","finding_id":"arf_v1_wleseolejcs67e5dfazmlwepne","finding_key":"operation/durablestepoperation::adapt::zero-delay-retry-compatibility","identity_key":"operation/durablestepoperation::adapt::zero-delay-retry-compatibility","line":87,"observation_digest":"163dcec2d0b78300ed041144aa815d6174b415f62ff56d876d3d36c8f9328c9d","observation_id":"aro_v1_cy645qwqw6bqb3iecfckvak5mf","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/operation/DurableStepOperation.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_wleseolejcs67e5dfazmlwepne","published_at":"2026-08-31T20:14:00Z","review_id":"arr_v1_vsawrd6bwahlguvzaltcuyhfjn","reviewed_base_sha":"6501c39f553655583e33238eb1d821e4f44b8e26","reviewed_head_sha":"2cf8683021bcc60007829a928009e5cb0c9b5285","reviewer":"codex","start_line":87,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":607},"record_id":"art_v1_dzoxakl3li6qsv42up7eonyt4j","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-08-31T20:14:00Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
